Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:13.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I lived only because I was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:22.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wake up, go to work, eat, sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:25.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just repeating the routines drilled into my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was my "life".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:36.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I worked like I was punishing my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:44.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I worked without thinking, wanting to forget everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:49.28,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Okazaki-kun, why don't you call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:51.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm almost done with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.79,0:00:59.33,Default,Man,0,0,0,,It's great you're working hard,\Nbut you'll break down if you keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:02.21,Default,Man,0,0,0,,You haven't even taken a break this summer yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.21,0:01:05.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's no problem. I'm doing this because I enjoy doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:10.18,Default,Man,0,0,0,,If you don't take some time off,\NI'll get yelled at by the government, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:18.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After work and days off were torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I used money to waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.11,0:01:28.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Taking a look at reality, and it felt like things would break down from the ground up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I hate this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:38.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But there isn't anything I can do to leave this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:42.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I lived so I didn't have to think about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:07.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I didn't want to think about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:10.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wanted to remain oblivious to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:15.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I thought of everything as a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The fact that I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:24.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The fact that I dated and married her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:26.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And the fact that I had a child with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:31.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All of those were mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:54.66,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf24}ki{\kf23}mi {\kf20}da{\kf22}ke {\kf33}ga {\kf32}su{\kf19}gi{\kf27}sa{\kf19}t{\kf39}ta {\kf48}sa{\kf43}ka {\kf42}no {\kf39}to{\kf24}chu{\kf29}u {\kf75}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:54.66,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
