Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:03:00.29,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}...is now covered with many spots of sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:05.50,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf27}bo{\kf21}ku {\kf40}hi{\kf45}to{\kf43}ri {\kf85}ga {\kf24}ko{\kf22}ko {\kf43}de {\kf35}ya{\kf41}sa{\kf41}shi{\kf55}i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:05.50,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm standing here alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:13.18,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf21}a{\kf21}ta{\kf44}ta{\kf35}ka{\kf55}sa {\kf80}wo {\kf19}o{\kf27}mo{\kf44}i {\kf45}ka{\kf34}e{\kf96}shi{\kf24}te{\kf190}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:13.18,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}remembering all the heart-warming memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:20.85,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}{\kf45}ki{\kf47}mi {\kf61}da{\kf65}ke {\kf197}wo  {\kf24}ki{\kf65}mi {\kf61}da{\kf26}ke {\kf176}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:20.85,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}You were the one... You were the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:27.07,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}su{\kf67}ki {\kf214}de {\kf65}i{\kf65}ta{\kf129}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:27.07,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...who I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:34.82,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf44}ka{\kf43}ze {\kf64}de {\kf62}me {\kf211}ga {\kf71}ni{\kf67}ji{\kf26}n{\kf185}de
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:34.82,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}My eyes start to water from the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:41.79,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:41.79,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:44.08,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf14}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf23}ma{\kf21}de{\kf22}mo {\kf14}o{\kf26}bo{\kf25}e{\kf23}te{\kf20}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:44.08,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.92,0:03:46.21,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.92,0:03:46.21,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.42,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.42,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.17,0:03:50.92,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.17,0:03:50.92,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:54.89,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.59,0:03:54.89,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:04:00.14,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:04:00.14,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:16.20,Default,Rob,0,0,0,,If junk only takes shape by wishing from one's heart, then I couldn't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:20.33,Default,Rob,0,0,0,,I already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:22.62,Default,Rob,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:25.25,Default,Rob,0,0,0,,Because I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:27.92,Default,Rob,0,0,0,,...not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:39.39,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:43.52,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Did you remember something sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:47.65,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It's this world that's sad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:54.57,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,This place will soon be completely white.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:05:02.37,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,If I can't move, then you'll become alone, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:27.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:30.15,Default,San,0,0,0,,Hello, Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:31.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:34.23,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Were you still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:37.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:39.91,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes. I came alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.41,0:05:42.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Will you give me a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:45.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's really messy, so I'll clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:49.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 17
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:49.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Summertime
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.50,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's a very hot day, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:55.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:59.47,Default,San,0,0,0,,You have to step outside once in a while to refresh yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:03.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. Yoshino-san says that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:06.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But, going out alone on a hot day like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:09.27,Default,San,0,0,0,,Then come on a date with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:10.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:14.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What brought this on all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:16.28,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:19.49,Default,San,0,0,0,,I just want to go on a date with young people once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:23.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then why don't you find someone besides me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:25.04,Default,San,0,0,0,,I won't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:29.71,Default,San,0,0,0,,You're very handsome and kind; you fit my likings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:34.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's not true. I'm always spoiled by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This place has changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:45.47,Default,San,0,0,0,,You don't come to the train station often?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:47.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, not this side of the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:55.44,Default,San,0,0,0,,Can you take an extended vacation this summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:07:00.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm being hassled to take one by the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:03.82,Default,San,0,0,0,,Then how about we go somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just us two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That'd be pretty exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:09.29,Default,San,0,0,0,,That would be good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:12.33,Default,San,0,0,0,,But this time, let's all go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.21,0:07:14.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"All"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:16.09,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes. All together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.05,0:07:20.76,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Mom! Hurry! Let's get some drinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:24.26,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Stop that. You'll trouble the other customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:31.02,Default,San,0,0,0,,Let's go. Akio-san's been wanting to have a drink with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:32.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:34.69,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:38.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:49.12,Default,San,0,0,0,,This is Sanae.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:51.46,Default,San,0,0,0,,Have you decided about going on a trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:54.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, no. I haven't thought about it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:57.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,Then I'll call back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:01.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why is she so forceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:05.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:07.76,Default,San,0,0,0,,Have you given it some thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:11.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:14.02,Default,San,0,0,0,,Then you'll go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:14.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:20.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll ask for a break towards the end of the week so I'll get four days off including Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:22.69,Default,San,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:31.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:36.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But it felt like saying "no" to her now would be betraying her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:42.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After all, I've forced everything onto her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:53.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.64,0:08:56.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:16.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:21.71,Default,San,0,0,0,,Something came up, so I must leave with Akio-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.67,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:56.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:17.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:56.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey now, you don't have to be so nervous. Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:02.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san and the old man went out, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:06.94,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:09.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, listen. Sanae-san's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.49,0:11:11.86,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Akki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.86,0:11:13.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The old man's not here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:23.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They both left without a word to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:27.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:30.55,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I wanna go on the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:32.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:34.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Neither Sanae-san nor the old man are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:37.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Or what? Do you want to go alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:40.48,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I wanna go with Sanae-san and Akki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I told you, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:00.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's with this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:11.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,For these last five years, I've left Ushio with Sanae-san and the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:16.72,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: The Seven-Five-Three Festival celebrate children's growth when they reached the ages seven, five, and three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:16.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I ignored her entry into kindergarten\Nand the Seven-Five-Three Festival, and worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:24.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san brought Ushio to my place from\Ntime to time, but I hardly looked at her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:28.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:35.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You think you're hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:36.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can totally see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:39.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop standing there and come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.59,0:12:50.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:54.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:13:00.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's see. I think both Sanae-san and\Nthe old man will come back by tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:03.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So be a good girl and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:06.39,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:09.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We can go once the old man and Sanae-san come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Play around yourself for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:13.36,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:18.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's like a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:22.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:31.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:32.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It because you run like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:34.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Does it hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Looks like you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:37.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Watch out from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.82,0:13:55.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You were playing with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:14:00.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And he broke when you dropped him, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:03.45,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Poor turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.25,0:14:10.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Maybe some superglue will fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.21,0:14:14.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Give me a minute. I'll put him back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:36.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You can still see the crack a little, but it shouldn't be too obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:40.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't play with him until he dries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.49,0:14:42.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Or else the wheels will stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:46.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did she understand what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:48.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:14:59.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.67,0:15:01.47,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,He won't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:10.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I told you not to move him until he dried, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.69,0:15:13.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The wheel's not going to move anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:15.15,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Can't fix him anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:16.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:17.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:19.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want to throw him away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.49,0:15:23.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.87,0:15:34.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you still need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:36.04,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:38.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So they're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:40.88,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Not back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:42.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:49.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:55.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I guess I'll go buy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:56.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you have anything you want to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:59.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If not, I'll go buy stuff randomly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:08.70,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,Why, Okazaki-san. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:10.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:14.58,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,How nice, Ushio-chan. Shopping with your dad today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.71,0:16:17.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Since when...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:20.25,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,You're living separately from her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:26.18,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,I can imagine. Raising a small child alone as a man is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:28.85,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,Oh, but you do see her from time to time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:31.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes, once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:34.60,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,I'm sure it must be lonely for her not to be able to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:37.86,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,After all, you're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Y-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:44.86,Default,Iso,0,0,0,,Bye bye, Ushio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.30,0:17:02.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You can eat by yourself, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:11.68,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Itadakimasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:27.16,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,It's bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Bitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:35.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, the pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:38.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it's not a fried rice without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:40.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Suck it up and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:41.17,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:45.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey. Sanae-san told you not to be picky, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:49.30,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to eat Sanae-san's food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then don't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.23,0:18:05.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Will it be all right if there's no pepper in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:05.94,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:08.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But it'll taste bad without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.24,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:11.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.53,0:18:13.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'll eat just rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:13.95,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:17.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sure, that's easy for me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:18.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:23.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Rice with fried rice as a side, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:24.96,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:27.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:28.30,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Just this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:33.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It looks like I'm abusing you if there's no side dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:47.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Rice seasoning, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.37,0:18:53.87,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Itadakimasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:07.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Maybe they're not coming home today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:29.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.99,0:19:32.16,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:33.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.17,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I did it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.17,0:19:47.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:55.18,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Let's swim a lot, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:56.18,Default,Boy,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:06.90,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:07.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:09.44,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:10.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:31.38,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I did it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:33.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't brag about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:35.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can do it myself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:45.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want to go on a trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.73,0:20:47.02,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:50.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then how about just the two of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:52.53,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.15,0:20:55.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You sure? It'll just be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.91,0:20:58.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Neither Sanae-san nor the old man will be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:00.28,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,But they're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:04.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. They aren't coming, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:05.04,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:08.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:10.29,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:21.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You got everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:22.18,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.77,0:21:24.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Locked everything up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.06,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:28.98,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:41.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Before today, either Sanae-san or the old man were always there whenever I saw Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:49.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is the first time for us\Nto be alone since she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:22:01.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Where are we headed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:08.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5\pos(459,847.5)}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:12.00,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:12.00,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.74,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.78,0:23:44.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:47.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Think about those around you a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.41,0:23:48.45,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.45,0:23:49.04,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.70,0:23:53.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey. If you're going to the bathroom, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.25,0:23:55.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.76,0:24:09.72,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 18
